OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTurning increasingly cloudy
OL,6,Fthrough the day with outbreaks of
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Some brighter spells possible
OL,8,Fto the east of high ground. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening through the day with
OL,10,Fgales possible in the north of
OL,11,FScotland. Milder than of late.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FGales possible in north
OL,14,FScotland this evening. Staying cloudy
OL,15,Fwith drizzly outbreaks across the
OL,16,Fsouth and east. A spell of heavy rain
OL,17,Fmoves into the north and west. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
