OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FHeavy rain moves across
OL,6,FEngland and Wales during the morning
OL,7,Fwith blustery winds, but turning drier
OL,8,Fand brighter in the afternoon. Heavy
OL,9,Fshowers move into the north later.
